    "title": "US to remove Syria from terror blacklist, in boost for Al-Sharaa",
    "description": "WASHINGTON: The United States said Wednesday it will delist Syria as a state sponsor of terrorism, a decades-old designation that severely impeded investment, in a new vote of confidence in leader Ahmad Al-Sharaa. Secretary of State Marco Rubio notified Congress of the long-expected move, which will be effective in 45 days unless lawmakers take the unlikely step of blocking it.",
